3752+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"This Co-op Shooter , has Day and Night levels, multiple maps, players will take on 25 enemy types and numerous bosses, like Gargantuan Monsters and Minibosses every 10 days as you explore, shoot and run for your life against the onslaught of porcine monstrosities.","detailedDescription":"End Credits Metal Music - Josh of When Evil Calls\n\nPlease Check Out - When Evil Calls on ReverbNation !!!\n\nUp To 6 Player CO-OP\n\nPlay Up To 6 Player CO-OP with your friends, or just random people. Now featuring Horde Mode where you can play with 6 players and unlock new characters.  So far in 1 month we have added many mini updates, a total of 6 characters, added in 2 new weapons, the beloved paintball gun with 4 colors, more achievements and LeaderBoards.\n\nJust Updated\n\nNewly added Crosshair Workshop, with developer mods coming soon.   Create and share your own mods with other players, and subscribe to the ones you like all from inside Blood and Bacon.\n\nAbout the Game\n\nAll You Need is Blood and Bacon\n\nBlood And Bacon is a Multiplayer Shooter that pits heavily armed players against undead deadstock as you attempt to butcher your way through 100+ levels of insanity and twitching gristle. Day and night levels, players will take on 25 enemy types and numerous bosses, like the gargantuan monster affectionately named, ‘Princess Blubbergut’ and Minibosses every 10 days as you explore, shoot and run for your life against the onslaught of porcine monstrosities. The game creatively dispenses pickups through a meat grinder, from the very creatures you are killing. Ammo boxes, Adrenaline, Grenades, Rockets, and other exotic boosters. Boasting over 15+ hours of gameplay and the ability to battle a staggering (or shambling) 500+ undead creatures at once, \"Blood and Bacon\" looks to feature more barnyard excitement than you can shake Old MacDonald’s severed femur at !!","aboutGame":"All You Need is Blood and Bacon\n\nBlood And Bacon is a Multiplayer Shooter that pits heavily armed players against undead deadstock as you attempt to butcher your way through 100+ levels of insanity and twitching gristle. Day and night levels, players will take on 25 enemy types and numerous bosses, like the gargantuan monster affectionately named, ‘Princess Blubbergut’ and Minibosses every 10 days as you explore, shoot and run for your life against the onslaught of porcine monstrosities. The game creatively dispenses pickups through a meat grinder, from the very creatures you are killing. Ammo boxes, Adrenaline, Grenades, Rockets, and other exotic boosters. Boasting over 15+ hours of gameplay and the ability to battle a staggering (or shambling) 500+ undead creatures at once, \"Blood and Bacon\" looks to feature more barnyard excitement than you can shake Old MacDonald’s severed femur at !!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/header.jpg?t=1736946173"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736946173"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/ss_5c1b2423a4e02643ee1f24fdc6a48cbc3b087d57.600x338.jpg?t=1736946173","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/ss_5c1b2423a4e02643ee1f24fdc6a48cbc3b087d57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1736946173"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/ss_2cc711c4f2d09ee6fb022c5026b42fa9e1181104.600x338.jpg?t=1736946173","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434570/ss_2cc711c4f2d09ee6fb022c5026b42fa9e1181104.1920x1080.jpg?t=1736946173"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai